<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>02 / 现状盘点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>手把手教学：会话状态机与三处记录边界</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#E8A33D' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>部分实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={300} viewBox='0 0 700 300'><rect x='0' y='30' width='161' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='161' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='26' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='80.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>复用已有解析</text><text x='80.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>优先复用</text><path d='M162 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M176 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='179' y='30' width='161' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='179' y='30' width='161' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='205' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='205' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><text x='259.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>构建教学步骤</text><text x='259.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>step_prompt / step_answer</text><path d='M341 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M355 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='358' y='30' width='161' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='358' y='30' width='161' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='384' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='384' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><text x='438.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>teach_check 检查</text><text x='438.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>判断本步回答</text><path d='M520 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M534 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='537' y='30' width='161' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='537' y='30' width='161' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='563' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='563' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='617.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>推进或留在当前步</text><text x='617.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>后端规则</text><path d='M40 200 L660 200' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='5 5'/><path d='M40 200 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#00A9B5'/><text x='350.0' y='226' font-size='15' fill='#00A9B5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>阶段之间可回退：变式暴露某步不会 → 返回该步训练</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>实现要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>优先复用已有解析，再由 _fs 生成 step_prompt / step_answer，经 teach_check 检查后由后端规则推进或留在当前步骤。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>命令分支：跳过、请求提示、查看答案；几何题可释放图形提示。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>记录边界一：跳过分支会写 correct=true，不能只统计 correct 判断掌握。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>记录边界二：无“提示后答对”的独立字段；记录边界三：看答案后答对 ≠ 独立完成。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>仓库虽有 teach_chat.md，但主路径 _do_chat_turn 使用预生成问题 + teach_check + 后端规则。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：当前实现能力与名词数量.md §5</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 17 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>